      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just so tired. i moved here thinking it would be different, a fresh start, but it's the same thing. i go through the motions every day, i talk to people, i try to be present... but it's like there's this wall between me and everyone else. i feel like i'm just performing being a person, but no one is actually watching. it's exhausting to keep pretending like any of this matters.",
